{"id":1050401,"chapter_id":1050401,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"这是一栋很久没有人来过的房屋，屋外的墙壁上挂着枯萎的爬山虎，就像巨兽遗忘的断肢，在这里腐朽成骨。","style":3,"background":1056,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"踏上木质的台阶，木头互相碾压，发出令人牙酸的吱呀声，惊出了一两只小小的甲壳虫，飞向一旁。","style":3,"background":1056,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"可顺着它们飞翔降落的轨迹，你却发现，枯萎的枝丫旁边，出现了几缕绿色的新叶。","style":3,"background":1056,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"进入屋内，你顺着自己记忆中——不久前那场寒冷而又旷大的游戏中所见到的场景，来到了二楼。","style":3,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"爱缇？","style":2,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"我来接你了。","style":2,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"房门内无人回应。","style":3,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"你暗示跟来的追踪队员们不要轻举妄动，随后再次轻敲木门以示礼貌，并开了门。","style":3,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"房间内，那位曾驱使巨龙的禁闭者，此时正枕着一本陈旧的手工书，安睡在自己的床边，就像玩累的小孩一样。","style":3,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"……你倒是睡得舒坦。","style":2,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"唔……","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"不……不能违反规则……！","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"世界……世界是我的！","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"是是是，是你的。","style":2,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"你叹了口气，在众人面前再次对她使用了枷锁，随后，便将她交给了追踪队员，由他们将爱缇押送回MBCC。","style":3,"background":2059,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"爱缇在管理局里熟睡了三天，像是要把“创造一个世界”所消耗的力量全部补回来似的。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1050400},{"step":17,"content":"不过，既然她已经醒了——你的计划可以开始了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1050400},{"step":18,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"呼啊~~","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1050400},{"step":19,"content":"她伸了个懒腰，睡眼惺忪地看了看周围，终于认清了自己的处境，懒懒地笑了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1050402},{"step":20,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"看来这里是个审查室呀，我被抓了？要审查我吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1050402},{"step":21,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"可我破坏的是游戏世界，不是现实世界吧？这也要被追究责任吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1050402},{"step":22,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"再说了，明明毁灭世界的是你耶——预言之子。","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1050402},{"step":23,"options":["在这里我可不是"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401025,"trial_step":25,"course":3,"drawing":1050400,"choices":[{"text":"在这里我可不是","goto":26}]},{"step":24,"content":"我只是一个普通的……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1050400},{"step":25,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我懂~你是所谓的“局长”嘛，要审查我们这些不好好听话的……“禁闭者”。","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1050400},{"step":26,"content":"既然你都明白，那么，关于艾丝缇雅，我需要你交代里面的一切。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1050400},{"step":27,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"交代一切？","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1050401},{"step":28,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"你不是都通关了？还不了解吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1050401},{"step":29,"content":"你身为艾丝缇雅的创造者，掌控着里面的一切。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1050400},{"step":30,"content":"你当然能在“玩家”所无法看到的地方，进行改变。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1050400},{"step":31,"content":"说吧，把你做的一切都交代出来。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1050400},{"step":32,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我要说什么？我不知道你提这个问题的意义是什么。","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1050400},{"step":33,"content":"哼，看来你还是放不下巨龙的矜持……没关系，我们这里很开明，能理解。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1050400},{"step":34,"content":"爱缇看着你，皱起了眉头。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1050404},{"step":35,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"你明白个什……","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1050404},{"step":36,"content":"爱缇看着眼前的人，似乎有点不解，怎么感觉和她在天空岛接触到的预言之子，不太一样了？","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1050404},{"step":37,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我只是创造了一场盛大的，快乐的游戏呀，仅此而已啊~","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1050404},{"step":38,"content":"的确，这是一个好游戏。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1050404},{"step":39,"content":"但你不顾他人意志，强行更改“参数”，“设定”，乃至“命运”……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1050404},{"step":40,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我是GM（管理者）呀，你也说了，这里的一切本来就由我控制。","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1050400},{"step":41,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我决定着游戏的走向，胜利或者失败都不过是PL（玩家）们在我的手掌之中……","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1050400},{"step":42,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"挣扎出的结果罢了~","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1050402},{"step":43,"content":"呵呵，看样子，说出真心话了？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1050402},{"step":44,"content":"既然你能掌控一切，也更看重掌控一切的话……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1050402},{"step":45,"content":"那我也能猜到你都做了什么好事。给你个机会，自己坦白吧，我会考虑从轻发落的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1050402},{"step":46,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"哼，这就是你们世界的审查吗？真是死板又无聊。所以我才不喜欢这边的规则。","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1050402},{"step":47,"content":"但既然是规则，你就必须遵守。现在，好好交代你的所作所为——","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1050402},{"step":48,"content":"这个世界丢失的宝藏，是被你藏匿起来的吧？为了把我们世界也玩弄于鼓掌？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1050402},{"step":49,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1050401},{"step":50,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"丢失的宝藏？我藏了起来？哈？？你在说什么怪话呢，你们这儿能有什么——","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1050401},{"step":51,"content":"还在装傻吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1050401},{"step":52,"content":"你把手里的记录本径直甩向爱缇，爱缇防御式地接住了它。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1050400},{"step":53,"content":"最后一次机会，不肯说，就写！这上面的问题，你必须一字不落，一点不假地交代清楚。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1050400},{"step":54,"content":"不然，你就只能乖乖待在这里，永远也别想出来！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1050400},{"step":55,"content":"你毅然起身，略粗暴地撞开椅子，转身离去。审查室的门哐被锁上了，爱缇一个人被留在房间，满头问号。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1050400},{"step":56,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"莫名其妙！他以前明明不是这样的！","female_content":"莫名其妙！她以前明明不是这样的！","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_58","vo_trial_50401_1_58f"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1050405},{"step":57,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"脱离了我创造的世界，区区一个预言之子能做什么……？","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1050405},{"step":58,"content":"爱缇打开手里的本子，却发现上面密密麻麻地，写着她最为熟悉的内容：姓名、种族、职业、武器……","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1050405},{"step":59,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"这个不是角色资料吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1050405},{"step":60,"content":"随便扫了两眼，爱缇霎时间就明白了你的意思——这是一张空白的人物卡，也是一场新游戏的邀请函。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1050405},{"step":61,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"哈，原来在这等着我呢？有意思有意思……","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1050402},{"step":62,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"那我就看看……你到底想跟我玩什么吧！","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1050402},{"step":63,"content":"你在门口待了一段时间后，便听到里面的爱缇在呼唤你。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401065,"trial_step":65},{"step":64,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"喂~我把该写的都写好了！","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401066,"trial_step":66},{"step":65,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"喏，你看看呗？","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1050402},{"step":66,"content":"你努力保持着脸上严肃的表情，接过本子仔细看了看。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1050400},{"step":67,"content":"<i>“哼，勉强坦白了一些情况。但还不够。”</i>","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1050400},{"step":68,"content":"<i>“想要弥补犯下的过错，你还有很长的路要走。做好觉悟吧！”</i>","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1050400},{"step":69,"content":"测试音效的打断逻辑","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":71,"course":6,"drawing":1050400},{"step":70,"content":"播放一个长音效，会有个前奏，稍等一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":71,"course":6,"drawing":1050400},{"step":71,"content":"播放相同音效，会继续延续。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":71,"course":6,"drawing":1050400},{"step":72,"content":"暂停配置音效，这里测试一下打断。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":71,"course":6,"drawing":1050400},{"step":73,"content":"播放一个稍短的音效，在这里等待它结束。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":71,"course":6,"drawing":1050400},{"step":74,"content":"配置同名音效，看能否再次播放。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":71,"course":6,"drawing":1050400},{"step":75,"content":"结束测试。","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":71,"course":6,"drawing":1050400},{"step":76,"content":"<i>“不知何时起，罪恶与黑暗，笼罩在这片土地上。”</i>","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1050400},{"step":77,"content":"<i>“人们渴望和平，渴望光明，于是人们不停地向圣人祈祷。”</i>","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1050400},{"step":78,"content":"<i>“圣人们终于给他们带来希望——一个能驱散黑暗的魔盒，唯有心怀光明与勇气，智慧与善良并存的冒险家们，才能打开它。”</i>","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1050400},{"step":79,"content":"<i>“所有的冒险家都想得到这个魔盒，可是它却突然不见了踪影……”</i>","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1050400},{"step":80,"content":"<i>“传言，世界之外的巨龙吞噬了这个魔盒，藏在了不为人知的地方……”</i>","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1050400},{"step":81,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"这是什么设定，不是闪闪发光的宝藏，巨龙可不会感兴趣……","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1050402},{"step":82,"content":"<i>“法师爱缇，被人所误解的巨龙使者，为了洗刷自己的清白，决意寻找回那个丢失的魔盒宝藏。”</i>","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1050402},{"step":83,"content":"<i>“不过亲爱的孩子，你现在陷入囹圄，被孤独掩盖，可请相信，命运和失败绝无法困住自由的巨龙。”</i>","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1050402},{"step":84,"content":"<i>“朝着命运的方向前进吧，你将获得你想到，或者你不曾想到的一切。”</i>","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1050402},{"step":85,"content":"<i>“找到那座失落的城堡，获得魔盒，将黑暗驱散，白天和希望，以及足以填满内心间隙的宝藏，会出现在你的面前。”</i>","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1050402},{"step":86,"content":"<i>“记住，我亲爱的孩子，往命运指引的方向前进吧。”</i>","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1050402},{"step":87,"content":"你微笑着，学着爱缇的样子，双手手指交叉，托着自己的下巴，看着爱缇。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1050402},{"step":88,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"有趣，很有趣。","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1050402},{"step":89,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我倒要看看，你能带我玩一个什么样的游戏。","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_85"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1050402},{"step":90,"content":"签字笔在爱缇的手指之间轮流转了个圈，最后啪地一声，被拍在了桌面上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1050402},{"step":91,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"很久没有作为玩家参与一场游戏了。","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150401087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1050402},{"step":92,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"希望我对规则还没有生疏。","voice":["vo_trial_50401_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_